def solution():
    '''
    Create a function solution that returns the answer of the following question: Square $ ABCD $ has side length $10$. Point $E$ is on $\overline{BC}$, and the area of $ \triangle ABE $ is $40$. What is $ BE $? [asy]size(4cm);
pair A,B,C,D,E;
A=(0,0);
B=(0,50);
C=(50,50);
D=(50,0);
E = (30,50);
draw(A--B);
draw(B--E);
