Let $w = z + \frac{1}{z}.$  Then $|w|^2 = w \overline{w} = z \overline{z} + 2 + \frac{1}{z \overline{z}} = |z|^2 + 2 + \frac{1}{|z|^2}.$  Hence,
\[|w|^2 - 4 \le 0,\]so $|w| \le 2.$

Let $z = re^{i \theta},$ so
\[w = re^{i \theta} + \frac{1}{re^{i \theta}} = \frac{r^2 e^{2 i \theta} + 1}{re^{i \theta}}.\]Then
\[|w|^2 = \frac{r^4 + 2r^2 \cos 2 \theta + 1}{r^2} = r^2 + 2 \cos 2 \theta + \frac{1}{r^2}.\]Hence,
\[r^2 + 2 \cos 2 \theta + \frac{1}{r^2} - 4 \le 0,\]so
\[r^4 - 4r^2 + 1 \le 0.\]This factors as $(r^2 - 2 - 1)(r^2 - 2 + 1) \le 0,$ so $1 \le r^2 \le 3.$

